# CountUp - a number that counts up from 0 the first time it comes into view, keeping its exact format («2.4M»,
# «94 %», «12,400», «$1.2M»). It takes the size of what holds it. Off with reduced motion.
#   Stat(label: "citas al mes") { CountUp(to: "12,400") }
# shadcn-for-muten · Custom · host JS count-up.js.
part CountUp(to: text) { Custom CountUp inputs(to: $to) class("cx-countup") }
